{"unit_id":"Leo-Cjw__dsh-pharos#card-zh","repo":"Leo-Cjw/dsh-pharos","commit":"4314c36d50d86eb73096c846e96749683eca8437","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pharos 是面向 DSH 桌面与 Web 客户端的会话通知插件，通过浏览器端状态订阅和 host 事件流连接提醒逻辑，并在 DSH 设置中提供消息通知面板。它可在需要用户处理、会话完成、出错、中断、用量上限和工作流阶段变化时显示通知与提示音，也支持安静时段、子代理过滤、会话跳转、当轮用量摘要及可配置的 Webhook 推送。适合希望离开页面后仍能留意 DSH 任务进度，并将事件转发到团队消息渠道的用户。安装后可在设置页管理提醒策略和推送渠道；无需额外 API 密钥，Webhook 目标由用户配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-29","lib/host.js:104-129","lib/client.js:420-450","lib/settings-view.js:49-59"]}
{"unit_id":"Leo-Cjw__dsh-pharos#card-en","repo":"Leo-Cjw/dsh-pharos","commit":"4314c36d50d86eb73096c846e96749683eca8437","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pharos sends DSH alerts when input is needed, a reply completes, or errors and workflow changes occur. It supports sounds, session navigation, quiet hours, subagent filtering, usage summaries, and configured webhooks. Manage alerts in settings; no extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-29","lib/host.js:104-129","lib/client.js:420-450","lib/settings-view.js:49-59"]}
